    <!-- Playback feature guide -->
    <string name="player_guide_title">Video playback guide</string>
    <string name="player_guide_previous">Previous</string>
    <string name="player_guide_done">Done</string>
    <string name="player_guide_overview_library">Find local, web, and WebDAV series you have added. Use Continue watching to pick up where you left off.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_overview_local">Add a video folder from your device. Scanning identifies titles and episodes from filenames so you can browse by series after matching.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_overview_web">Play a direct video link, parse a web page to select an episode, or search by title using a source rule.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_overview_webdav">Browse scanned series on your server, review matches, and choose episodes to play.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_webdav_setup">Enter your server address, account, and media root, then test the connection. Save the settings and open the WebDAV library to see scans and matches.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_web_direct">Paste a direct video link, such as an MP4 or M3U8 URL, into the field above and tap Direct play.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_web_parse">Paste the link to a series or playback page into the field above and tap Parse web page. When episodes are found, you can choose an episode and switch sources.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_web_rules">Rules tell the app how to search a site and find its episodes. Select a built-in rule, enter a series title, and search. Use Manage to import compatible Kazumi HTML or API rules.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_local_add">Choose a video folder and grant access. The app scans it automatically and groups files by series and episode where possible. Rescan under Scan and match, then confirm or correct matches on the series cards.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_webdav_directories">Browse and play videos using the folder structure on your server. You can also open files that have not been matched yet.</string>
    <string name="player_guide_webdav_scan">The first connection scans the media directory automatically. The app uses filenames and folders to identify series and episodes. Rescan after adding files. Review the matches on series cards and match manually when needed. Confirmed matches can update watch progress when you finish an episode.</string>
</resources>
